Hi Jonathon and Raf, I am unable to locate any existing process for Security Assessment of new suppliers. (Apps, services etc).

Please share with me if you are aware of something that already exists.

In the meantime, using the school [https://res-2.df.onecdn.static.microsoft/files/fabric-cdn-prod_20251010.003/assets/item-types/16/docx.svg] policy<https://mbsedu.sharepoint.com/:w:/s/Cyber_Security/IQCObhxctRc0SInRlNV8oyu9ARkPE1jkfMfrsNrntkME5rg?e=AbV2Al> and advice from the vCISO I have drafted this [https://res-2.df.onecdn.static.microsoft/files/fabric-cdn-prod_20251010.003/assets/item-types/16/docx.svg] process<https://mbsedu.sharepoint.com/:w:/s/Cyber_Security/IQB2LnemqgcHSqOgokQ83MbHAYZUhA03gUR1NcoTd6WCar0?e=Neejnl> and an agent to perform the evaluation. Attached is the report output.

I would like to get any feedback I can from you incorporated and then I will share to Mandeep and Glenn and share the agent with you to trial.

Regards
Pete

--_000_MEYPR01MB6423285C20517896ABC55299E0E82MEYPR01MB6423ausp_
